{"title":"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/4/6f4b576028120ee0f9ae1d7c11b8703193b7b3a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = ax + (1 - a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" /> for some unknown number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.<br />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Then, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/4/62434ae80ca145c20f0fbc7563f5151371ed163c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/b/02b1f71c2ba9b8d1f01c2a402a84ebfefd59f6cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0dd1169058fdc329d8cf3792b9820b1bba79c99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 = 3a + 1 - a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/836167d02aec34924e7dc65d04c5dc5c3217f57f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a + 1 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/7/107bcf6afb904548d2b8dd6296cd475ed009417b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 7 - 1 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/0/3808a675e05e62b33a894f8b79267cedce96ca61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{6}{2} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The equation is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/9/8c96a77309f3f88d0381e956e1ed7c9409e4293a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3x + (1 - 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"132\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/f/fcfa412082115e601a8b4a6d07c90d574c901b70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3x - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/4/62434ae80ca145c20f0fbc7563f5151371ed163c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/8/3c8aa1382fc2c796b6ee30b88669f2c4e7f17eab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3 \\times 8 - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/7/d579d200b62ec2fbdedef96a6c6fc8a8853b9dc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 24 - 2 = \\boxed{22}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"139\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC\" title=\"2013 CIMC\">2013 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018055731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 128/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1289/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 140/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: